WEBVTT

00:02:58.841 --> 00:03:00.832
wek lezkirina dil,

00:03:00.832 --> 00:03:02.757
bêhnvedan

00:03:02.757 --> 00:03:04.329
û reaksîyonên fîziksel

00:03:04.329 --> 00:03:05.921
normal bibe.

00:03:05.921 --> 00:03:07.849
Zanist hê jî

00:03:07.849 --> 00:03:11.581
feydeyên rondika baş nizanin.

00:03:11.581 --> 00:03:14.643
Dibe ku tevgereke cîvakî be.

00:03:15.078 --> 00:03:17.116
Gorî hin xebatan jî,

00:03:17.818 --> 00:03:19.766
rondik

00:03:19.766 --> 00:03:22.240
ACTH, enkefalîn, endorfîn

00:03:22.024 --> 00:03:23.652
wek êşbiran

00:03:23.652 --> 00:03:25.656
hormonên stresê dihewîne.

00:03:26.666 --> 00:03:30.423
Rondik psîkolojiya îrîsê